# Pyroclasm kills Bot2's Grizzly Bears (power 2) and Elvish Mystic (power 1) together. "Whenever a creature an opponent controls with the
# greatest power among creatures that player controls dies" looks back (CR 603.10a, 700.4): just before they died Bears had the greatest
# power, so it triggers Kraven once - for the Bears, not for the Mystic, though the Mystic's death is in the same event. Bot1 draws a card
# and Kraven gets a +1/+1 counter (4/3 to 5/4).

